OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,8,Fmostly light rain towards Skye,
OL,9,FLochaber and the Western Isles.
OL,10,FScattered showers further north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FRather cloudy with some
OL,13,Fpatchy rain in the south. Bright
OL,14,Fspells and just a few showers in the
OL,15,Fnorth in the morning will spread south
OL,16,Fto all parts later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
